  "name": "AUGMANITAI Compendium — Wave 1 (104 Terms)",
  "description": "A systematic terminology for human experiences in AI interaction. Wave 1 release: 104 terms from the AUGMANITAI Compendium V2.1. By Andreas Ehstand — Independent Researcher, Tennis & Padel Coach, Terminology Researcher. New words for new worlds. Stay human. ❤️🤖",
